CONFIGURE DISCOVERY SERVICE
===========================================================

Configure Eureka Discovery Server.

Requirements

• Enable Eureka Server.

• Configure only application.properties.

• Never generate YAML files.

• Configure server port.

• Enable Spring Boot Actuator.

• Expose health and info endpoints.

Verify the Eureka Dashboard loads successfully.

===========================================================
CONFIGURE EVERY MICROSERVICE
===========================================================

Configure every service as a Eureka Client.

Each service must

• Register automatically with Eureka.

• Discover other services.

• Use application.properties only.

Configure

Application Name

Server Port

Eureka Client

Actuator

Health Endpoint

Info Endpoint

Logging

